    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At <strong>3rd Level</strong> whenever you take the <em>Ki Blast Action</em> you may fire an additional <em>Basic Ki Blast</em> as part of that Action.</p>\n<p>At <strong>9th Level</strong> when you use your Action to take the <em>Attack Action</em> or the <em>Ki Blast Action</em>, you may take the <em>Ki Blast Action</em> as your Bonus Action.</p>\n<p>At <strong>15th Level</strong> whenever you take the <em>Ki Blast Action</em> you may fire an additional <em>Basic Ki Blast</em> as part of that Action.</p>\n",
